ch is  on its course to look for a new planet  to live in the ark is being controlled  by evolved creatures who speak a  completely different language the movie  ends as the spaceship blasts into space  leaving the Blue Planet behind forever  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notification locations and leave a  like to help the channel out thank you  for watching

